  ('1c5a49ec-aa6a-4f30-a663-60b00cc90c5d'::uuid, 0, 'Look at the pattern in the grid. Which option belongs in the empty cell?', 'انظر إلى النمط في الشبكة. أيّ خيار يناسب الخانة الفارغة؟', NULL, '["A leftward-pointing arrow", "An upward-pointing arrow", "A downward-pointing arrow", "A rightward-pointing arrow"]'::jsonb, '{"kind":"grid","cols":2,"cells":[{"arrow":"up"},{"arrow":"right"},{"arrow":"down"},null],"options":[{"arrow":"left"},{"arrow":"up"},{"arrow":"down"},{"arrow":"right"}],"replaces":"1c5a49ec-aa6a-4f30-a663-60b00cc90c5d"}'::jsonb),
  ('9f631041-3fb6-463f-a979-39cec64cbd1b'::uuid, 2, 'Look at the pattern in the grid. Which option belongs in the empty cell?', 'انظر إلى النمط في الشبكة. أيّ خيار يناسب الخانة الفارغة؟', 'Every row and every column holds a white circle, a half-shaded circle and a fully shaded circle once each. Row 3 already has full and white, so the missing cell is the half-shaded circle; the third column (full, white, ?) confirms it. ''Fully white'' and ''fully shaded'' repeat a state already in the row. ''Right half shaded'' never appears in the grid.', '["A fully white circle", "A fully shaded circle", "A circle with its left half shaded", "A circle with its right half shaded"]'::jsonb, '{"kind":"grid","cols":3,"cells":[{"shape":"circle","fill":"none"},{"shape":"circle","fill":"left"},{"shape":"circle","fill":"full"},{"shape":"circle","fill":"left"},{"shape":"circle","fill":"full"},{"shape":"circle","fill":"none"},{"shape":"circle","fill":"full"},{"shape":"circle","fill":"none"},null],"options":[{"shape":"circle","fill":"none"},{"shape":"circle","fill":"full"},{"shape":"circle","fill":"left"},{"shape":"circle","fill":"right"}],"replaces":"9f631041-3fb6-463f-a979-39cec64cbd1b"}'::jsonb),
  ('ef2960dc-a122-4321-9bdc-be21cbe6c4ca'::uuid, 0, 'Look at the pattern in the grid. Which option belongs in the empty cell?', 'انظر إلى النمط في الشبكة. أيّ خيار يناسب الخانة الفارغة؟', NULL, '["Four dots", "Three dots", "Two dots", "Five dots"]'::jsonb, '{"kind":"grid","cols":2,"cells":[{"dots":1},{"dots":2},{"dots":3},null],"options":[{"dots":4},{"dots":3},{"dots":2},{"dots":5}],"replaces":"ef2960dc-a122-4321-9bdc-be21cbe6c4ca"}'::jsonb),
  ('5b06229e-46f7-42df-9e01-0cd37b3dd002'::uuid, 0, 'Look at the pattern in the grid. Which option belongs in the empty cell?', 'انظر إلى النمط في الشبكة. أيّ خيار يناسب الخانة الفارغة؟', NULL, '["Square with 1 dot", "Triangle with 1 dot", "Square with 3 dots", "Circle with 1 dot"]'::jsonb, '{"kind":"grid","cols":3,"cells":[{"shape":"circle","side":{"count":1}},{"shape":"square","side":{"count":2}},{"shape":"triangle","side":{"count":3}},{"shape":"square","side":{"count":3}},{"shape":"triangle","side":{"count":1}},{"shape":"circle","side":{"count":2}},{"shape":"triangle","side":{"count":2}},{"shape":"circle","side":{"count":3}},null],"options":[{"shape":"square","side":{"count":1}},{"shape":"triangle","side":{"count":1}},{"shape":"square","side":{"count":3}},{"shape":"circle","side":{"count":1}}],"replaces":"5b06229e-46f7-42df-9e01-0cd37b3dd002"}'::jsonb),
  ('cd15e7c9-9f40-4f43-9d44-d95945752a1a'::uuid, 0, 'Look at the pattern in the grid. Which option belongs in the empty cell?', 'انظر إلى النمط في الشبكة. أيّ خيار يناسب الخانة الفارغة؟', 'Along every row one more small cell is shaded at each step. Row 1 shows the order the cells fill in: top-left, top-right, then bottom-right, then bottom-left (clockwise). Row 3 has top-left, then top-left and top-right, so the next step adds bottom-right. The option ending in bottom-left goes counter-clockwise. ''Two shaded'' fails to add a cell. ''Four shaded'' adds two cells at once.', '["Three shaded: top-left, top-right, and bottom-right", "Three shaded: top-left, top-right, and bottom-left", "Two shaded: top-left and bottom-right", "Four shaded: all small cells"]'::jsonb, '{"kind":"grid","cols":3,"cells":[{"quad":["tl","tr"]},{"quad":["tl","tr","br"]},{"quad":["tl","tr","br","bl"]},{"quad":[]},{"quad":["tl"]},{"quad":["tl","tr"]},{"quad":["tl"]},{"quad":["tl","tr"]},null],"options":[{"quad":["tl","tr","br"]},{"quad":["tl","tr","bl"]},{"quad":["tl","br"]},{"quad":["tl","tr","br","bl"]}],"replaces":"cd15e7c9-9f40-4f43-9d44-d95945752a1a"}'::jsonb),
